%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a 2x2 gray image whose samples come through an ASCIIHexDecode
% filter over currentfile. The image reads the filter through its `>`,
% so showpage on the next line runs; the page is the same as
% graphics/gray-image.ps produces from an inline string.
100 100 translate
50 50 scale
%%BeginData: 2 ASCII Lines
2 2 8 [2 0 0 -2 0 2] currentfile /ASCIIHexDecode filter image
0055AAFF>
%%EndData
showpage
